  "allOriginalTitles": [
    "paints the artifact under the policy the shell already ships",
    "does not run the artifact, behind two fences either of which would hold",
    "refuses the artifact cleartext subresources by scheme and its font by directive",
    "loads the artifact https images the directive admits, and still refuses its font",
    "sends no referrer with an admitted https image, which is the shell header doing it",
    "asks to navigate the top frame to the shell itself, which the shell must refuse",
    "renders an artifact link as text against a shell that cannot open one",
    "changes nothing an engine renders except that links are not links",
    "taps a fragment link, which navigates this frame rather than scrolling it",
    "hands a user's tap on a link to the top frame, exactly once",
    "cannot reach the shell through a meta refresh at the embedder's own URL",
    "hands up nothing without a tap, and nothing for a form or a new window",
    "reads the frame while a navigation it expects has not arrived",
    "gives up on a navigation that is not coming, and names why",
    "keeps the Preview/Source toggle, and Source shows the source"
